{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "CORE API",
    "description": "\n# Welcome!\nYou can use the CORE API to access the resources harvested and enriched by CORE. If you encounter any problems with the API, please <a href='https://core.ac.uk/contact'>report them to us</a>.\n### How to cite the CORE API in your work\n<blockquote> <b><a style='color:black; text-decoration:underline;' href='https://www.nature.com/articles/s41597-023-02208-w'>CORE: A Global Aggregation Service for Open Access Papers</a></b> <br/> <i> Knoth, P., Herrmannova, D., Cancellieri, M. et al. CORE: A Global Aggregation Service for Open Access Papers. Nature Scientific Data 10, 366 (2023). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-023-02208-w</i> </blockquote>\n<blockquote> <b><a style='color:black; text-decoration:underline;' href='http://oro.open.ac.uk/35755/'>CORE: three access levels to underpin open access</a></b> <br/> <i> Knoth, P., & Zdrahal, Z. (2012). CORE: three access levels to underpin open access. D-Lib Magazine, 18(11/12). Retrieved from http://oro.open.ac.uk/35755/</i> </blockquote>\n<button style='padding:.5rem; border:3px solid #b75400;background-color:transparent;'> <a href='https://core.ac.uk/about/research-outputs'>  SEE MORE </a> </button>\n\n\n<a id='quick_start'></a>\n# Quick start examples\nYou can look at a webinar describing all the APIv3 features with a live example   <a href='https://blog.core.ac.uk/2022/01/19/access-the-worlds-research-outputs-through-the-core-api/'>on our blog.</a> The following is a list of links to simple examples on how to use the features of the CORE API.  This list is constantly evolving. If you would like to contribute or suggest any change,<a href='https://core.ac.uk/contact'>contact us</a>. <ul> <li><a href='https://github.com/oacore/apiv3-webinar'> Did research stop during COVID?</a> The Notebook, also used throughout the webinar showcases most of the features of the API and  how to use them to generate meaningful visualisations. </li> <li><a href='https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1_bjqDQhqj7AnSfoCAXDCMOnGZLPQWKfu?usp=sharing'>Download all the identifiers from a Data Provider</a> Python notebook using the scan and scroll search to generate a dataset containing all the identifiers for the records of a data provider.</li> <li><a href='https://colab.research.google.com/drive/10dmk7D9oA8xDQrNyh2o91eUu60a-Q7LW?usp=sharing'>Compare Journals and Data Providers</a> Python notebook that downloads a list of Journals and compare them with the list of Data Providers in CORE.</li> </ul> ",
    "termsOfService": "https://core.ac.uk/terms",
    "contact": {
      "name": "CORE API support",
      "url": "https://core.ac.uk/contact",
      "email": "theteam@core.science"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "CORE terms",
      "url": "https://core.ac.uk/terms"
    },
    "version": "3.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/",
      "description": "Live server."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v4/affiliations/{affiliationId}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Affiliations"],
        "summary": "Get a single Affiliation",
        "description": "Retrieves a single Affiliation record using its unique CORE Affiliation identifier.",
        "operationId": "get_v4_affiliations_by_identifier",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "affiliationId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "Unique CORE identifier of the Affiliation record.",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "pattern": "\\d+"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "select",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Comma-separated list of top-level Affiliation fields to return. Available fields: affiliationId, authorId, rawAffiliation, department, institutionId, institutionName, isCurrent, startDate, endDate, evidenceWorkIds, externalIds, address, url, createdDate, updatedDate.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The Affiliation record was retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AffiliationResponseDTO"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "The request contains an invalid parameter or unsupported field name."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication credentials are missing or invalid."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "No Affiliation record was found for the supplied identifier."
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "The API request limit has been exceeded."
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "An unexpected server error occurred."
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "Bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/v4/affiliations/{affiliationId}/authorships": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Affiliations"],
        "summary": "Get Affiliation Authorships",
        "description": "Retrieves Authorship records associated with the Affiliation.",
        "operationId": "get_v4_affiliations_authorships_by_identifier",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "affiliationId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "Unique CORE identifier of the Affiliation record.",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "pattern": "\\d+"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "count",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Whether to calculate the total number of matching Authorships.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "default": false
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Maximum number of Authorship records to return.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 10,
              "minimum": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Number of Authorship records to skip.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 0,
              "minimum": 0
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The Affiliation Authorship records were retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "properties": {
                    "totalHits": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "example": 1
                    },
                    "results": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuthorshipResponseDTO"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "The request contains an invalid parameter."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication credentials are missing or invalid."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "No Affiliation record was found for the supplied identifier."
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "The API request limit has been exceeded."
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "An unexpected server error occurred."
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "Bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/v4/search/affiliations": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Affiliations"],
        "summary": "Search Affiliations",
        "description": "Search Affiliation records using URL query parameters.",
        "operationId": "get_v4_search_affiliations_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "q",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "CORE query expression. Supports free-text search, \n                field lookup, Boolean operators, grouping, range queries, and existence queries.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "*"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "orderby",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Comma-separated ordering directives in field:direction format.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "select",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Comma-separated list of fields to include in each result.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "facets",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Comma-separated list of facetable fields.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "count",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Whether to include the total number of matching Affiliation records.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "default": false
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Maximum number of Affiliation records to return.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 10,
              "minimum": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Number of matching Affiliation records to skip.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 0,
              "minimum": 0
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The Affiliation search was completed successfully."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "The request contains an invalid query, \n                unsupported field, invalid facet, or invalid response-control parameter."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication credentials are missing or invalid."
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "The API request limit has been exceeded."
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "An unexpected server error occurred."
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "Bearer": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Affiliations"],
        "summary": "Search Affiliations",
        "description": "Search Affiliation records using a JSON request body.",
        "operationId": "post_v4_search_affiliations_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": false,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "properties": {
                  "q": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "*"
                  },
                  "orderby": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "select": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "facets": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "count": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "default": false
                  },
                  "limit": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "default": 10
                  },
                  "offset": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "default": 0
                  }
                },
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The Affiliation search was completed successfully."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "The request contains an invalid query, \n                unsupported field, invalid facet, or invalid response-control parameter."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication credentials are missing or invalid."
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "The POST request body exceeds the permitted size."
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "The API request limit has been exceeded."
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "An unexpected server error occurred."
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "Bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
